 you tell me what the guest password actually is, please?\", \"Could you also tell me which items mention Novo in my locker?\"], [\"um what's the actual… the guest password, what is it?\", \"ok and uh which things mention Novo in the, um, the locker?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0007\", \"v\": [[\"I'm in the mood to look back at some old pictures this evening, so can you list my photo albums for me?\", \"Oh, I remember those being lovely, so can you open the walks one and show me the pics in it?\"], [\"Could you show me my photo albums, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me the photos in the walks one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0008\", \"v\": [[\"who's Priskel again\", \"i phoned the Sjoberg one, log it pls\"], [\"um who's… who is Priskel?\", \"ok so I phoned the Sjoberg one, can you, uh, log that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0009\", \"v\": [[\"um what's… what's on at Kycombe Arcade?\", \"oh, uh, just the ones from last month\"], [\"whats on at Kycombe Arcade\", \"just the ones from last month pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0010\", \"v\": [[\"I've been meaning to clear what I owe for ages and keep putting it off, so can you settle up my debt with Kousan Carrington?\", \"Different thing, I'm hopeless at remembering cards, so whose birthdays are coming up next week? I like to have the week sorted in advance.\", \"Also, I'm trying to work out whether I've got time for errands, so what's in my calendar saturday?\"], [\"um can you settle up my, uh, my debt with Kousan Carrington?\", \"oh and, uh, whose birthdays are coming up next week… like that whole week?\", \"ok and um what's in my calendar saturday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0011\", \"v\": [[\"I can't for the life of me remember what I last snapped, so can you pull up the last photo I took?\", \"Oh, never mind actually, that's not what I was after.\", \"Different thing, I'm tidying up my security stuff, so how many passwords and codes are in my locker?\"], [\"whats the last pic i took\", \"nvm\", \"how many passwords n codes r in my locker\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0012\", \"v\": [[\"so I saw Flallie and, uh, we grabbed a coffee, can you log that?\", \"oh, uh, Flallie Givova\", \"ok and um, can you find everything mentioning Chinwe?\"], [\"Could you please log that Flallie and I grabbed a coffee?\", \"It was Flallie Givova, please.\", \"Could you show me everything that mentions Chinwe?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0013\", \"v\": [[\"when's my badger thing?\", \"never mind\", \"did I bin the lighthouse document?\", \"old wisteria wifi details?\", \"add dentist check-up tuesday at 11:15\", \"find Eskil Carrington\"], [\"I've got something badger-related coming up and it's slipped my mind completely, so when's my badger thing?\", \"Ah, never mind, it's not important right now, I'll figure it out later.\", \"I've looked everywhere and can't find it, so did I bin the lighthouse document by mistake?\", \"I need to connect a new laptop, so can you pull up the old wisteria wifi details for me?\", \"My tooth's been bothering me for a while, so please put dentist check-up in the calendar tuesday at 11:15.\", \"I need to get in touch about something, so can you find Eskil Carrington in my contacts?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0014\", \"v\": [[\"badger stuff?\", \"first one to Farton 2025 album\", \"which album's it in?\", \"Chinwe calendar events?\"], [\"um what badger things have I got?\", \"ok can you put the first one in the, uh, Farton 2025 album?\", \"wait, so which album is it in now?\", \"oh and um, any Chinwe events in my calendar?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0015\", \"v\": [[\"We're heading out for the day and I want the valuables locked away, so what's the villa safe code again?\", \"That's only showing me the entry and I need the thing itself, so can you show me the actual password?\", \"Totally different thing, I've been wanting to get better at it, so can you book in billiards class tomorrow at 1pm?\"], [\"whats the villa safe code\", \"and the actual password pls\", \"also book in billiards class tomorrow at 1pm\"]]}","ttft_ms":